<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E gets PLN 5.8 mln payout.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E gets PLN 5.8 mln payout.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading firm Mostostal Export SA received 5.8 million zlotys in the first tranche of a dividend payment from  Bankowe Towarzystwo Leasingowe SA (BTL) bank leasing society, Mostostal said.</p>
<p>BTL, which is 69-percent owned by Mostostal, decided to allocate its entire 30.2 million zloty profit in 1995-1996 to dividend payments.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
